      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "i like the world - social tabs but i think that the performance and game settings should actually be in settings instead of in safety. the launchpad tabs (not wings) should be really minimal and the wings let you decide the extra stuff you wanna see on it, then have simple buttons open up to the main menus. maybe make the launchpad world - safety tabs a little smaller and add a settings tab. make the icon for the hud and nameplate settings in launchpad an eye instead of a gear, and use the gear icon for the settings.",
