  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-02-02T23:35:19.387Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I use the settings button more than any other in the menu so putting the settings button in the main menu would be amazing. And I absolutely hate how it's so close to the exit button. It's very confusing. I usually click on one of the quick menu buttons to get to the settings. Here are some good plans and problems that need to be looked at for the future.",
